// Count of the winning labeled hammings strictly less than the greatest.
// When none are strictly below, that count is not a kept below.
// Ordinary program: no HOLD_FLASH line.

CUBE hunder ROLE observer PROTON 1
CUBE rank ROLE nanobot  PROTON 1

PLUG hunder rank

IMPULSE hunder 1
IMPULSE rank 1
ENERGYFLOW 1
FLOW 1
HARMONY rank
DECIDE rank
ASSERT CUBES >= 2
PRINT "hunder" UNITY DECIDE ENERGY
